# Implementation plan — Spec 1.13.2

## Summary

Add a **Company profile** page with **three cards**: Company profile, Contact information, Location information (Google Map + address). Clicking a company on **All Companies** or SA **Companies** opens the profile. Registration is **slim** (name required); remaining contact/location details are completed on the profile. Backend: `GET` / partial `PATCH /company/:id`, map columns, relaxed register validation.

See [02](./02-company-profile-page.md), [03](./03-list-navigation.md), [04](./04-company-detail-api.md), [05](./05-registration-and-progressive-details.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.13.2` |
| Prerequisite | 1.13.0 All Companies + SA Companies lists |
| Services | WebOnOne (+ Identity for JWT / roles) |
| New env | `VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY` (frontend `.env.example`) |

